MAIN='Main shell-coverage series grown on a divided preparation of approximately 40 Å CdSe cores. The captions often call the core 42 Å ±10% (SAXS), whereas Table 1 reports the bare TEM major dimension as 39 Å ±8.2%. This is not a unique batch identifier or an exact recipe-to-each-trace assignment.'
