SAXS='Separate dilute-hexane solution-SAXS series: a=bare 42 Å dots; b Zn/Cd=0.42, c=0.85, d=3.1, e=5.3 in Figure 11 caption. The text explicitly excludes direct comparison with the other measurements in Table 1. A p8 body sentence prints 5.6 for e; this unresolved conflict is retained.'
